[32m+[m[32m**Primary use cases:**[m
[32m+[m[32m- Currency conversion[m
[32m+[m[32m- Time-period normalization[m
[32m+[m[32m- Forecasting[m
[32m+[m[32m- Contextual business analysis[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m**Potential integration methods:**[m
[32m+[m[32m- Approved APIs[m
[32m+[m[32m- Scheduled data feeds[m
[32m+[m[32m- Controlled reference datasets[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m**Sensitivity:** Generally low, subject to source terms and company policy.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m**Data owner:** Finance / IT[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m**Outstanding questions:**[m
[32m+[m[32m- Which external data is necessary?[m
[32m+[m[32m- Which sources are approved?[m
[32m+[m[32m- Which exchange-rate methodology is used?[m
[32m+[m[32m- What data licensing restrictions apply?[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m---[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## 4. Integration Requirements[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m### INT-REQ-01: Read-only source access[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mInitial integrations must not modify source-system business records.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m### INT-REQ-02: Approved integration methods[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mAll integrations must use methods approved by the company's IT and security teams.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m### INT-REQ-03: Source system identification[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mEvery ingested dataset must identify its originating system.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m### INT-REQ-04: Data freshness[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mThe system must track:[m
[32m+[m[32m- Last successful extraction[m
[32m+[m[32m- Last source update where available[m
[32m+[m[32m- Extraction timestamp[m
[32m+[m[32m- Data coverage period[m
[32m+[m[32m- Refresh status[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m### INT-REQ-05: Incremental extraction[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mWhere supported, integrations should extract changed records instead of repeatedly processing all data.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m### INT-REQ-06: Failure handling[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mFailed integrations must:[m
[32m+[m[32m- Record errors[m
[32m+[m[32m- Support retry[m
[32m+[m[32m- Avoid duplicate ingestion[m
[32m+[m[32m- Preserve the last valid dataset[m
[32m+[m[32m- Clearly communicate stale data[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m### INT-REQ-07: Data validation[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mExtracted data must be validated for:[m
[32m+[m[32m- Required fields[m
[32m+[m[32m- Data types[m
[32m+[m[32m- Duplicate records[m
[32m+[m[32m- Missing identifiers[m
[32m+[m[32m- Invalid dates[m
[32m+[m[32m- Currency consistency[m
[32m+[m[32m- Referential integrity[m
[32m+[m[32m- Unexpected record counts[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m### INT-REQ-08: Data lineage[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mEvery dataset and analytical result must preserve source traceability.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m### INT-REQ-09: Permission enforcement[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mData access must respect user roles and applicable source-system permissions.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m### INT-REQ-10: Configuration[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mIntegrations must be configurable without hardcoding credentials or business-specific connection details.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m---[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## 5. Data Quality Requirements[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mThe system must evaluate:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m### Completeness[m
[32m+[m[32mAre required records and fields present?[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m### Accuracy[m
[32m+[m[32mDo values match the authoritative source?[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m### Consistency[m
[32m+[m[32mAre customer IDs, product IDs, currencies, dates, and definitions consistent?[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m### Timeliness[m
[32m+[m[32mIs the dataset sufficiently recent for the requested analysis?[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m### Uniqueness[m
[32m+[m[32mAre duplicate records or duplicated transactions present?[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m### Validity[m
[32m+[m[32mDo values conform to expected data types, ranges, and business rules?[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m### Referential Integrity[m
[32m+[m[32mDo transactions reference valid customers, products, accounts, and organizational dimensions?[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mData quality problems must be visible and must not silently contaminate analytical outputs.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m---[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## 6. Data Ownership and Governance[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mEach source must have:[m
[32m+[m[32m- Business owner[m
[32m+[m[32m- Technical owner[m
[32m+[m[32m- Approved access method[m
[32m+[m[32m- Sensitivity classification[m
[32m+[m[32m- Retention requirements[m
[32m+[m[32m- Refresh schedule[m
[32m+[m[32m- Data quality responsibility[m
[32m+[m[32m- Access approval status[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mThe copilot must not become the authoritative system of record for operational transactions.[m
[32m+[m
